# Deliberately a short blacklist, not the allow-list used in ~/newsletter.
# This repo IS the deployed site: GitHub Pages publishes what is committed, so
# anything ignored here simply does not ship. Keep it to genuine local noise.
#
# The data files (prices/products/history/sealed/hashes.json) are NOT ignored --
# the daily Actions job commits them on purpose and the site fetches them.

# Local test + tooling noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.memsearch/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Visual regression captures — large PNGs, regenerated on demand by shots.py
.shots/

# Detector fixtures: generated set + Mason's real photos (not for the repo)
.lotfix/

# Android signing material. This repo IS the deployed site -- GitHub Pages
# publishes what is committed -- so a keystore committed here would be
# downloadable at holomint.app/android-keystore.jks by anyone. That is the app
# signing key: whoever has it can publish an update to your listing.
# Back it up somewhere private; never here.
*.jks
*.keystore
android-keystore.*
keystore.properties
twa-manifest.json.bak

# Bubblewrap / Android build output (large, regenerable, and app-release-*.aab
# is a signed binary that has no business on a static site)
app-release-*.aab
app-release-*.apk
/android/
.gradle/
